Z||000000||Rodney||02-05-2001||12:18 PM||||Looking for any 4 or 5 speed rear manual transmission<BR>brackets. I convert them to fit the 5 speed Getrags. I can use<BR>any 4 or 5 speed brackets from any year Fiero. This is<BR>the clam shaped bracket that bolts to the rear of the<BR>trans. 1/8" steel.<P>I'm also always looking for any cast iron levers. I<BR>rework them also to fit the Getrags. This is the lever<BR>the slave pushes against.<P>People that wish to convert to a FWD Getrag need these parts as GM is out of them. To make the rear bracket from scratch would be a lot of work and not look as nice. If you replace a bad trans save the rear brackets!! <P>Thanx,<BR>Rodney Dickman||||reg||7
